#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement encodesExactUtf8Bytes encodeUtf8 returns the exact UTF-8 byte sequence for the given text, for the empty string, ASCII-only text, and multi-byte (non-ASCII) text.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
